{"title":"Kormik · A record that's yours","styles":"\n    .sc-placeholder{background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent);\n      border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 50%,transparent);\n      border-radius:2px;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden}\n    @keyframes sc-shine{0%{background-position:100% 50%}100%{background-position:0% 50%}}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing{position:relative;\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 5%,transparent);\n      border-color:transparent}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder::before,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing::before{content:'';\n      position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;\n      background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(217,119,87,0) 25%,rgba(247,225,211,.95) 37%,rgba(217,119,87,0) 63%);\n      background-size:400% 100%;animation:sc-shine 1.4s ease infinite}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder:nth-child(n+9 of .sc-placeholder)::before,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing:nth-child(n+9 of .sc-interp.sc-missing)::before{animation:none;\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent)}\n    .sc-placeholder-error{padding:4px 8px;font:11px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;\n      color:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 70%,transparent);word-break:break-word}\n    .sc-interp.sc-missing{display:inline-block;width:2em;height:1em;overflow:hidden;\n      vertical-align:text-bottom;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n      border-radius:2px;box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;\n      user-select:none}\n    .sc-interp.sc-unresolved{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:.85em;\n      color:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 50%,transparent);\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 10%,transparent);border-radius:3px;\n      padding:0 3px}\n    .sc-host.sc-has-error{position:relative}\n    .sc-logic-error{position:absolute;top:8px;left:8px;z-index:2147483647;max-width:60ch;\n      padding:6px 10px;background:#b00020;color:#fff;font:12px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;\n      border-radius:4px;white-space:pre-wrap;pointer-events:none}\n    /* Mirrors PRINT_BASELINE_CSS in apps/web deck-stage-export.ts — keep both\n       in sync until dc-runtime regains a build step. */\n    @media print {\n      @page { margin: 0.5cm; }\n      figure, table { break-inside: avoid; }\n      #dc-root, #dc-root > .sc-host { height: auto; }\n      *, *::before, *::after {\n        print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;\n        backdrop-filter: none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;\n        animation-delay: -99s !important; animation-duration: .001s !important;\n        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; animation-fill-mode: both !important;\n        animation-play-state: running !important; transition-duration: 0s !important;\n      }\n    }\n  \n/* ---- */\nx-dc{display:none!important}\n/* ---- */\nhtml,body{height:100%;margin:0}#dc-root,#dc-root>.sc-host{height:100%}\n/* ---- */\n\n    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n    @media (max-width: 860px) { [data-screen-label=\"Memory\"] .k-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }\n    #hero-mark { -webkit-mask-image: url(assets/logos/kormik-mark-orange.png) !important; mask-image: url(assets/logos/kormik-mark-orange.png) !important; -webkit-mask-size: contain !important; mask-size: contain !important; -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat !important; mask-repeat: no-repeat !important; -webkit-mask-position: center !important; mask-position: center !important; }\n    body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); }\n    a { color: var(--indigo); text-decoration-color: var(--orange); }\n    a:hover { color: var(--indigo); }\n    @media (max-width: 768px) { .k-nav__menu, .k-lang__opt, .k-chip { min-height: 44px; } .k-btn--link { min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; } }\n    @media (max-width: 1180px) { [data-screen-label=\"The record\"] .k-container > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } [data-screen-label=\"The record\"] .k-container > div > div:last-child { justify-content: center !important; } }\n  \n/* ---- */\n body { margin: 0; background: transparent; } a { color: #0d0e60; } a:hover { color: #0d0e60; } ","html":"<div class=\"sc-host\" data-sc-name=\"Home\"><div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"13\" style=\"display: contents;\"><header class=\"k-nav\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"k-nav__inner\"><a href=\"Home.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__logo\"><img src=\"assets/logos/kormik-lockup-orange-indigo.png\" alt=\"Kormik\" height=\"40\"></a><nav class=\"k-nav__links\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"Home.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link is-active\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a><a href=\"Why it matters.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">Why it matters</a><a href=\"For clients.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">For clients</a><a href=\"Approach.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">Approach</a><a href=\"About.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">About</a><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">Join</a></nav><div class=\"k-nav__end\"><div class=\"k-lang\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Language\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"k-lang__opt is-active\" aria-pressed=\"true\">EN</button><button type=\"button\" lang=\"bn\" class=\"k-lang__opt\" aria-pressed=\"false\">বাং</button></div><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--primary k-btn--sm\">Get early access</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"k-nav__menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Menu</button></div></div></header></div><main data-dc-tpl=\"14\"><section data-dc-tpl=\"15\" data-theme=\"indigo\" data-screen-label=\"Hero\" style=\"background: var(--indigo); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); min-height: min(-81px + 100vh, 820px); display: grid; align-items: center; padding-block: 48px; overflow: hidden; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n  \n<div data-dc-tpl=\"16\" class=\"k-container\" style=\"width: 1316px; box-sizing: border-box; height: 563px;\">\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"17\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 40px 56px; align-items: center; width: 1195px; height: 633px;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"18\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; min-width: 0px;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"19\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"20\" style=\"width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--orange); display: inline-block;\"></span>Pre-launch preview · Opening in Dhaka first</p>\n        <h1 data-dc-tpl=\"21\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(34px, 3.6vw, 52px) / 1.08 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Nearly 7 crore people keep Bangladesh working. <span data-dc-tpl=\"22\" style=\"color: var(--orange);\">84 in 100 have no record of it.</span></h1>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"23\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender); max-width: 46ch;\">At dawn they wait at the roadside to be picked for a day's work. They build the roads, the homes, the shops. At the end of the day the cash changes hands, and nothing shows they were ever there.</p>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"24\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); max-width: 46ch;\">Kormik is a record that's yours. Every day of work recognised, paid and protected.</p>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"25\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; padding-top: 4px;\">\n          <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"26\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--primary k-btn--lg\">I want work<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n          <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"27\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"For clients.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--secondary k-btn--lg\">I need a crew<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n        </div>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"28\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; color: var(--lavender-dim); max-width: 48ch;\">About 6.9 crore people in work; 84% of them informal, about 5.8 crore. BBS Labour Force Survey 2024.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"29\" id=\"hero-mark\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 520px; aspect-ratio: 465 / 512; justify-self: center; min-width: 0px; background: var(--orange); mask-image: url(&quot;assets/logos/kormik-mark-orange.png&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center;\">\n        <img data-dc-tpl=\"30\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616610269931-04d58b579ddf?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=entropy&amp;w=900&amp;h=1000&amp;q=75\" alt=\"A day labourer in Dhaka at a brick kiln\" style=\"object-fit: cover; display: block; position: absolute; left: 23px; top: 13px; width: 609px; height: 532px; object-position: 55% 20%;\">\n        <img data-dc-tpl=\"31\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591260315238-79ee54d55fc5?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=500&amp;h=560&amp;q=75\" alt=\"A woman worker at a brick wall\" style=\"object-fit: cover; display: block; position: absolute; left: 11px; top: 66px; width: 126px; height: 112px; object-position: 50% 30%;\">\n        <img data-dc-tpl=\"32\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1669127707497-fb31ace516a1?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=500&amp;h=800&amp;q=75\" alt=\"Men working on a building\" style=\"object-fit: cover; display: block; position: absolute; left: 30%; top: 0px; width: 104px; height: 182px; object-position: 50% 20%;\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"33\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"The problem\" style=\"background: var(--paper); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"34\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"35\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 40px 64px; align-items: center;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"36\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"37\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">Work today</p>\n        <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"38\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo);\">Every morning, a lottery. Every workday, unrecorded.</h2>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"39\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink); max-width: 46ch;\">The money changes hands. The proof never does. When the pay comes short, when the next contractor asks for experience, when someone gets hurt on site, there is nothing to point to.</p>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"40\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 20px 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 20px;\">\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"41\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"42\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: tabular-nums; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; font-family: Ubuntu, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo);\">3 in 4</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"43\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 6px 0px 2px; color: var(--ink);\">wage earners are paid only in cash.</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"44\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">World Bank Global Findex 2025</p></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"45\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"46\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: tabular-nums; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; font-family: Ubuntu, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo);\">1 in 3</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"47\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 6px 0px 2px; color: var(--ink);\">paid employees have only a spoken agreement.</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"48\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">BBS Labour Force Survey 2024</p></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"49\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"50\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: tabular-nums; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; font-family: Ubuntu, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo);\">9.6 lakh</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"51\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 6px 0px 2px; color: var(--ink);\">people hurt or made ill by work in one year.</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"52\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">BBS Labour Force Survey 2024</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"53\"><div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"54\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"Why it matters.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--link k-btn--md\">Why it matters<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"55\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto auto; gap: 12px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"56\" style=\"grid-column: 1 / -1; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--slot);\">\n          <img data-dc-tpl=\"57\" src=\"assets/work-crowd.jpg\" alt=\"Workers waiting behind a bamboo barrier to be picked for the day\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 40%; display: block;\">\n        </div>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"58\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--slot);\">\n          <img data-dc-tpl=\"59\" src=\"assets/work-elder.jpg\" alt=\"An older worker in a headscarf among a waiting crowd\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 45%; display: block;\">\n        </div>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"60\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--slot);\">\n          <img data-dc-tpl=\"61\" src=\"assets/work-portrait.jpg\" alt=\"A worker with a spade over his shoulder and his bag, on a village road\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 30%; display: block;\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"62\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"Thesis\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"63\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"64\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n      <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"65\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(32px, 3.4vw, 48px) / 1.08 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2px; color: var(--indigo);\">The worker was never missing work. <span data-dc-tpl=\"66\" style=\"color: var(--orange);\">They were missing a record.</span></h2>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"67\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; align-items: center;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"68\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink); max-width: none;\">Everyone else built a service on top of the informal economy. Kormik builds the record underneath it.</p>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"69\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: none;\">The same people, the same crews, the same phone calls. Plus the one thing the work never had: a memory.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"70\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 32px 48px; margin-top: 48px;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"71\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--indigo); padding-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"72\" style=\"height: 88px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; color: var(--indigo);\"><k-trade-icon data-dc-tpl=\"73\" name=\"hammer\" size=\"64\"></k-trade-icon></div>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"74\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">They work.</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"75\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 32ch;\">A day on a site, in a home, in a shop. The same work, the same crew, the same speed as today.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"76\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--indigo); padding-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"77\" style=\"height: 88px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; color: var(--indigo);\"><svg data-dc-tpl=\"78\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path data-dc-tpl=\"79\" d=\"M6 2h8l5 5v13a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zm7 1.5V8h4.5zM8 12a1 1 0 1 0 0 2h8a1 1 0 1 0 0-2zm0 4a1 1 0 1 0 0 2h5a1 1 0 1 0 0-2z\"></path></svg></div>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"80\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">It's recorded.</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"81\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 32ch;\">That day goes on record, in the worker's own name. Not a slip in a pocket. A record that lasts.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"82\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--orange); padding-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"83\" style=\"height: 88px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"84\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 64px; aspect-ratio: 502 / 689; background: var(--orange); mask-image: url(&quot;assets/fingerprint.png&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\"></div></div>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"85\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">It's theirs.</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"86\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 32ch;\">The record belongs to the worker. It goes where they go, from job to job and year to year.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"87\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"The record\" style=\"background: var(--paper); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"88\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"89\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 380px) minmax(0px, 1fr); gap: 40px 48px; align-items: center;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"90\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; max-width: 420px;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"91\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--orange-ink);\">The product</p>\n        <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"92\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo);\">Their first record of work, <span data-dc-tpl=\"93\" style=\"color: var(--orange);\">ever.</span></h2>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"94\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 40ch;\">Who they are, what they do, and every day they have worked. In their own name, in their own hands.</p>\n        <ul data-dc-tpl=\"95\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n          <li data-dc-tpl=\"96\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"97\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1.5px solid var(--indigo); display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 13px; flex: 0 0 auto;\">✓</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"98\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--indigo);\">Something to show when the pay comes short</span></li>\n          <li data-dc-tpl=\"99\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"100\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1.5px solid var(--indigo); display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 13px; flex: 0 0 auto;\">✓</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"101\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--indigo);\">Proof of experience for the next job</span></li>\n          <li data-dc-tpl=\"102\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"103\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1.5px solid var(--indigo); display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 13px; flex: 0 0 auto;\">✓</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"104\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--indigo);\">Proof they were at work, the day it counts</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"105\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">Fictional worker. Preview · concept. Not yet a live service.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"106\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; min-width: 0px;\">\n        <div class=\"sc-host\" data-sc-name=\"RecordCard\" data-dc-tpl=\"107\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"5\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 28px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arimo, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n  \n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"6\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; flex: 1 1 280px; max-width: 360px; min-width: 0px;\">\n    <article data-dc-tpl=\"7\" aria-label=\"Work record card (concept)\" style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; background: rgb(13, 14, 96); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: rgba(13, 14, 96, 0.2) 0px 24px 60px; padding: 18px 20px 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"8\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; right: -40px; top: -24px; width: 200px; aspect-ratio: 502 / 689; background: rgb(27, 29, 122); mask-image: url(&quot;assets/fingerprint.png&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\"></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); border-radius: 11px; pointer-events: none;\"></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"10\" style=\"position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"11\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"12\" src=\"assets/logos/kormik-lockup-white.png\" alt=\"Kormik\" style=\"height: 20px; width: auto; display: block;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"13\" lang=\"bn\" style=\"font: 700 16px / 1 &quot;Anek Bangla&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 109, 2);\">কর্মীক</span></div>\n        <span data-dc-tpl=\"14\" style=\"font: 700 11px / 1 &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arimo, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(13, 14, 96); background: rgb(255, 109, 2); border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 12px; white-space: nowrap;\">Preview · concept</span>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"15\" style=\"position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0px, 1fr); gap: 16px; align-items: start;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"16\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 116px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(27, 29, 122); border: 2px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <img data-dc-tpl=\"17\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1679679811837-c28b2586f533?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces