dding: 22px 16px 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"37\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; right: -50px; top: 40px; width: 170px; aspect-ratio: 502 / 689; background: rgb(27, 29, 122); mask-image: url(&quot;assets/fingerprint.png&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\"></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"38\" style=\"position: relative; width: 56px; height: 5px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgb(8, 9, 63); margin-top: -8px;\"></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"39\" style=\"position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 4px;\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"40\" src=\"assets/logos/kormik-lockup-white.png\" alt=\"Kormik\" style=\"height: 14px; width: auto; display: block;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"41\" lang=\"bn\" style=\"font: 700 11px / 1 &quot;Anek Bangla&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 109, 2);\">কর্মীক</span></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"42\" style=\"position: relative; width: 88px; height: 104px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(27, 29, 122); margin-top: 6px; border: 2px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <img data-dc-tpl=\"43\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1679679811837-c28b2586f533?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces&amp;w=400&amp;h=480&amp;q=70\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; display: block;\">\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"44\" style=\"position: relative;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"45\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 14px / 1.2 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span class=\"sc-interp\">Mohammad Karim</span></p>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"46\" style=\"margin: 3px 0px 0px; font: 400 11px / 1.3 &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arimo, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(196, 198, 234);\"><span class=\"sc-interp\">Mason</span> · <span data-dc-tpl=\"47\" lang=\"bn\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Anek Bangla&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 109, 2);\"><span class=\"sc-interp\">রাজমিস্ত্রি</span></span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"48\" style=\"position: relative; display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; white-space: nowrap; margin-top: 2px;\">\n        <span data-dc-tpl=\"49\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: tabular-nums; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1; font-family: Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span class=\"sc-interp\">186</span></span>\n        <span data-dc-tpl=\"50\" style=\"font: 400 9px / 1.2 &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arimo, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(196, 198, 234);\">days of work recognised</span>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"51\" style=\"position: relative; margin-top: auto; width: 156px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px 5px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; box-sizing: border-box; height: 48px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"52\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 22px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(13, 14, 96) 0px, rgb(13, 14, 96) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 3px, rgb(13, 14, 96) 3px, rgb(13, 14, 96) 5px, transparent 5px, transparent 6px, rgb(13, 14, 96) 6px, rgb(13, 14, 96) 7px, transparent 7px, transparent 9px, rgb(13, 14, 96) 9px, rgb(13, 14, 96) 11px, transparent 11px, transparent 12px);\"></div>\n        <span data-dc-tpl=\"53\" style=\"font: 700 7px / 1 ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(13, 14, 96);\">KORMIK · DHAKA</span>\n      </div><p data-dc-tpl=\"54\" style=\"position: relative; margin: 0px; font: 700 8px / 1.2 &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arimo, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 109, 2); white-space: nowrap;\">A Kormik record that is yours</p>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"108\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"Two doors\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"109\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"110\" style=\"margin: 0px auto 40px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo); text-align: center;\">Work, or hire. Either way, it's on record.</h2>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"111\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 40px 64px; align-items: start;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"112\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 20px;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"113\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">For workers and Team Leaders</p>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"114\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Your work, on record.</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"115\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 46ch;\">Masons, helpers, rod binders, painters, electricians, plumbers, tile and carpentry workers, cleaners, loaders. Your first record of work, in your own name.</p>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"116\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 46ch;\">Already lead a crew? Join as a Team Leader. Keep your network, build a name for reliable work.</p>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"117\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; padding-top: 4px; align-items: center;\">\n          <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"118\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--primary k-btn--md\">I want work<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n          <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"119\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--link k-btn--md\">I lead a team<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"120\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 20px;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"121\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">For clients</p>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"122\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Need a crew? Hire people you can trust.</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"123\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 46ch;\">A Team Leader who answers for the crew, the right skills, and a clear record of who worked on your job. From a home repair to a public tender.</p>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"124\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(92px, 1fr)); gap: 14px 10px; padding: 4px 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"125\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><k-trade-icon data-dc-tpl=\"126\" name=\"plunger\" size=\"24\"></k-trade-icon><span data-dc-tpl=\"127\" class=\"small\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Plumbing</span></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"128\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><k-trade-icon data-dc-tpl=\"129\" name=\"roller\" size=\"24\"></k-trade-icon><span data-dc-tpl=\"130\" class=\"small\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Painting</span></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"131\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><k-trade-icon data-dc-tpl=\"132\" name=\"bolt\" size=\"24\"></k-trade-icon><span data-dc-tpl=\"133\" class=\"small\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Electrical</span></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"134\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><k-trade-icon data-dc-tpl=\"135\" name=\"tile\" size=\"24\"></k-trade-icon><span data-dc-tpl=\"136\" class=\"small\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Tiles and flooring</span></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"137\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><k-trade-icon data-dc-tpl=\"138\" name=\"saw\" size=\"24\"></k-trade-icon><span data-dc-tpl=\"139\" class=\"small\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Carpentry</span></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"140\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><k-trade-icon data-dc-tpl=\"141\" name=\"trowel\" size=\"24\"></k-trade-icon><span data-dc-tpl=\"142\" class=\"small\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Masonry</span></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"143\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><k-trade-icon data-dc-tpl=\"144\" name=\"snips\" size=\"24\"></k-trade-icon><span data-dc-tpl=\"145\" class=\"small\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Rod binding</span></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"146\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><k-trade-icon data-dc-tpl=\"147\" name=\"shovel\" size=\"24\"></k-trade-icon><span data-dc-tpl=\"148\" class=\"small\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Site labour</span></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"149\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><k-trade-icon data-dc-tpl=\"150\" name=\"pickaxe\" size=\"24\"></k-trade-icon><span data-dc-tpl=\"151\" class=\"small\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Earthworks and roads</span></div>\n          <div data-dc-tpl=\"152\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><k-trade-icon data-dc-tpl=\"153\" name=\"compass\" size=\"24\"></k-trade-icon><span data-dc-tpl=\"154\" class=\"small\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\">Public works</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"155\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; padding-top: 4px; align-items: center;\">\n          <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"156\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"For clients.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--primary k-btn--md\">I need a crew<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n          <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"157\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"For clients.dc.html#public-works\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--link k-btn--md\">Talk to us about public works<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"158\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"App preview\" style=\"background: var(--paper); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"159\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"160\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 32px;\">\n      <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"161\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo);\">The app, as we imagine it today.</h2>\n      <p data-dc-tpl=\"162\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 78ch;\">Open it. Say what you need. Choose a trade. See the crew. Built Bangla first, for basic phones. Preview · concept. The app is in development and will change.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"163\" style=\"border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 24px;\">\n      <img data-dc-tpl=\"164\" src=\"assets/app-preview.png\" alt=\"Four concept app screens: opening screen, hire a professional, choose a trade, a crew list\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\">\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"165\" data-theme=\"orange\" data-screen-label=\"Memory\" style=\"background: var(--orange); color: var(--indigo); position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"166\" class=\"k-container\" style=\"position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1.2fr) minmax(260px, 0.8fr); gap: 32px 48px; align-items: end;\">\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"167\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; padding-block: 88px;\">\n      <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"168\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(36px, 4vw, 60px) / 1.02 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.8px; color: var(--indigo);\">We don't replace the old way. We give it a memory.</h2>\n      <p data-dc-tpl=\"169\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); max-width: 52ch;\">The phone call, the Team Leader, the same crew at the same speed. Now every day of it is on record.</p>\n      <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"170\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"Approach.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--secondary k-btn--md\">How we think about it<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n    </div>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"171\" style=\"align-self: stretch; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; min-height: 380px;\">\n      <img data-dc-tpl=\"172\" src=\"assets/memory-worker.png\" alt=\"A worker with a shovel over his shoulder, rendered in paper\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 420px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"173\" data-theme=\"indigo\" data-screen-label=\"Journey\" style=\"background: var(--indigo-deep); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"174\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"175\" style=\"margin: 0px auto 48px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3.2vw, 46px) / 1.08 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\">Nearly 7 crore people build Bangladesh. We're building the way for every one of them to prove it.</h2>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"176\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 28px 24px;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"177\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"178\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"179\" style=\"width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid var(--lavender-dim); box-sizing: border-box; flex: 0 0 auto;\"></span><span data-dc-tpl=\"180\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; border-top: 2px dashed var(--lavender-dim);\"></span></div>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"181\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender-dim);\">Today</p>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"182\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender); font-size: 26px;\">Unrecorded</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"183\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender); max-width: 26ch;\">Cash in hand. No slip, no name, no date.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"184\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"185\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"186\" style=\"width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--orange); flex: 0 0 auto;\"></span><span data-dc-tpl=\"187\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; border-top: 2px solid var(--orange);\"></span></div>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"188\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender-dim);\">Step one</p>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"189\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 26px;\">Recognised</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"190\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender); max-width: 26ch;\">Every day of work, in the worker's own name.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"191\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"192\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"193\" style=\"width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--orange); flex: 0 0 auto;\"></span><span data-dc-tpl=\"194\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; border-top: 2px solid var(--orange);\"></span></div>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"195\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender-dim);\">Step two</p>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"196\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 26px;\">Paid</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"197\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender); max-width: 26ch;\">A record to stand on when the work is done.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"198\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"199\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"200\" style=\"width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--orange); flex: 0 0 auto;\"></span><span data-dc-tpl=\"201\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; border-top: 2px solid var(--orange);\"></span></div>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"202\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender-dim);\">Step three</p>\n        <h3 data-dc-tpl=\"203\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 26px;\">Protected</h3>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"204\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender); max-width: 26ch;\">Proof of experience, proof of presence, when it counts.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"205\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"Early access\" id=\"early-access\" style=\"background: var(--paper); padding-block: 80px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"206\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"207\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 32px 64px; align-items: center;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"208\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;\">\n        <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"209\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3.2vw, 46px) / 1.08 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2px; color: var(--indigo);\">Be there when Kormik opens.</h2>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"210\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 40ch;\">Tell us who you are and leave a number. Not yet a live service. Opening in Dhaka first.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"211\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"212\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">Early access</p>\n        <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"213\" style=\"display: contents;\"><form class=\"k-form\"><div class=\"k-form__roles\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Which describes you?\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\" class=\"k-chip is-active\">I want work</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"k-chip\">I lead a team</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"k-chip\">I need a crew</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"k-chip\">Government / public body</button></div><div class=\"k-field\"><span class=\"k-field__prefix\">+880</span><label class=\"k-sr\" for=\"k-phone\">Mobile number</label><input id=\"k-phone\" class=\"k-field__input\" type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"tel-national\" placeholder=\"Your mobile number\" required=\"\" value=\"\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--primary k-btn--md\">Join early access<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button></div><p class=\"k-form__note\">One text, when Kormik opens near you. Nothing else.</p></form></div>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"214\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin: 14px 0px 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">Partners, researchers and public bodies: <a data-dc-tpl=\"215\" href=\"Join.dc.html#partner\">write to us here</a>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section></main><div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"216\" style=\"display: contents;\"><footer class=\"k-footer\" data-theme=\"indigo\"><div class=\"k-container\"><div class=\"k-footer__top\"><div class=\"k-footer__brand\"><img src=\"assets/logos/kormik-lockup-white.png\" alt=\"Kormik\" height=\"36\"><p class=\"k-footer__tag\">A record that's yours. Every day of informal work in Bangladesh, recognised, paid and protected.</p></div><nav class=\"k-footer__links\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"Home.dc.html\">Home</a><a href=\"Why it matters.dc.html\">Why it matters</a><a href=\"For clients.dc.html\">For clients</a><a href=\"Approach.dc.html\">Approach</a><a href=\"About.dc.html\">About</a><a href=\"Join.dc.html\">Join</a></nav></div><div class=\"k-footer__base\"><span>© 2026 Kormik · kormik.com.bd · Pre-launch preview, made in Dhaka. Not yet a live service.</span><span>Figures: BBS Labour Force Survey 2024 · World Bank Global Findex 2025</span></div></div></footer></div></div>","links":["_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/fonts.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/icons.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/colors.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/typography.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/spacing.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/components.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/styles.css"]}